  "_fx": "fx: Guardian Signs effects (assets/fx/guardian_signs/<id>.png) played when the move resolves, in order. anchor: target (at each Pokémon hit, or the aimed tile), attacker (centred on the user), projectile (travels user -> target, rotated to its travel direction; the target parts after it play on arrival). mode: beam (tiled from user to target), stream (stretched from user to target), status (loops above the head). fps default 15, scale default 3 (pixels per source pixel), tint optional. Moves without fx fall back to the procedural family in vfx."
}
